  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India, Nepal. The project focuses on youth, organic farming and sustainable agriculture in underprivileged communities in Nepal and India. Youth are mobilised from rural communities, and taught traditional cropping practices. Through an intensive 12-month exchange program, the projects will turn the youth into change-makers.</narrative>
  </description>
